# The card of the first forty keys of Strata: one landscape page, three
# panels.  Every key on it is on the key reference leaflet and in the key
# list of the manual.  A key is always a keycap.
.doc Strata The First Forty Keys
.landscape
.margins 0.2
.keyscale 1.0
.numbering off
.linespace 1.3
.h1 Strata: the first forty keys
.panels 33 35 33
= MOVE
{k:Left} {k:Right} | One character left, right.

{k:Up} {k:Down} | One line up, down.

{k:PgUp} {k:PgDn} | Half a screen up, down.

{k:Home} {k:End} | Start, end of the line.

{k:Ctrl-Left} {k:Ctrl-Right} | One word left, right.

{k:Alt-F7} | Go To a section.

= TYPE AND DELETE
{k:Enter} | End the line.

{k:Tab} | Insert a tab.

{k:Del} | Delete the character under the cursor.

{k:Backspace} | Delete the character before.

= LOOK OF THE TEXT
{k:Ctrl-B} | Bold on, off.

{k:Alt-I} | Italics on, off.

{k:Ctrl-U} | Underscore on, off.

{k:Ctrl-N} | Normal text.
.next
= COPY AND MOVE TEXT
{k:F3} | Copy: choose Text, Column, Block or Section, then move the cursor
 over it.

{k:F4} | Cut: the same.

{k:F7} | Move: the same.

{k:Enter} | Accept the highlight.

{k:Esc} | Cancel it.

{k:F5} | Paste at the cursor.

= SEARCH
{k:F9} | Search.

{k:Alt-F9} | Search and replace.

= BUILD THE DOCUMENT
{k:Ctrl-A} | Append a block.

{k:F2} | Split here.

{k:Ins} | Append a section.

{k:Shift-Ins} | Append a subsection.

{k:Alt-1} | Show the headlines to level 1.

{k:Keypad +} {k:Keypad -} | Expand, collapse the section.
.next
= FILES
{k:Ctrl-S} | Save.

{k:Ctrl-R} | Retrieve a file.

{k:Ctrl-P} | Print.

{k:Ctrl-Q} | Leave the Editor.

= MENUS AND HELP
{k:F12} | The menu bar.

{k:Esc} | Back out of a menu or a panel.

{k:F1} | Help.

{k:Alt-F12} | Markers: pictures, notes, keycaps and equations.

= IN A PANEL
{k:Up} {k:Down} | Between fields.

{k:Ins} | Accept the panel.

{k:Esc} | Cancel it.

= WHEN A TERMINAL KEEPS A KEY
{k:Ctrl-F} | A list of every command with a function key.

{k:Ctrl-F12} | The markers, as {k:Alt-F12}.

{k:Alt-+} {k:Alt--} | Expand, collapse, as the keypad keys.

{k:Alt-F2} | The Append menu: Sub-section is {k:Shift-Ins}.

More keys: the key reference, {c:cheat.doc}.
.end
